&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _CONTROL Evento.FMax V-table-Win
ON MOUSE-MENU-DOWN OF Evento.FMax IN FRAME F-Main /* a */
DO:
{selfecha.i}
